std_probe.log — captured output of `std_probe.mojo` on the installed toolchain.
Development artifact under `_dev/`; never shipped.

Command (inside smd, from the repo root):
    smd mojo run mojoakku/string/_dev/std_probe.mojo

Toolchain: Mojo 1.1.0 (8189361e)
Date of capture: 2026-09-28

================================================================================
